{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112140/extras/37c595a2704e99527b1774566e82d8b5.avif?t=1771252366\" width=314 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Lord Verkins is a hand-drawn visual novel with beautiful artwork from different artists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the events of the Great War, Queen Verkins eventually took over her father's throne as one of the rulers of the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is lonely but has her best friend, Galzra, to talk to. This is a short visual novel that explores Galzra's and Verkins' relationship and explores more lore on both the Verkins and Leandro series. See how the bonds of these two grow in this short visual novel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStraightforward short romance visual novel story between Galzra and Verkins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSix chapters featuring Galzra talking to Verkins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbHand-drawn artwork drawn by different artists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMusic done by different music artists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSave and load system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbText available in English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbBeautiful women</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All characters depicted are over the age of 18.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is intended to be PG-13 with the\u00a0equivalent of a T rating of games rated by the\u00a0ESRB.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Credits:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game developed by</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Verkins and\u00a0NoranekoGames</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music by</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potat0Master, Tim Beek, and MaxStack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art by\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Verkins, Flufruf, AkaneKazami, ElShira9, and NoranekoGames</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112140/extras/f18e04e9a81e8723144a738a235fe05b.avif?t=1771252366\" width=614 height=460 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4112140?t=1771252366","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4112140?t=1771252366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112140/cdda60a917d98e5087f85b0b3dbf67f72171a6ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771252366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112140/cdda60a917d98e5087f85b0b3dbf67f72171a6ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771252366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"All characters depicted are over the age of 18.\u00a0\r\nSome lewd content & dialog.\r\nOne music track can be scary."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112140/extras/37c595a2704e99527b1774566e82d8b5.avif?t=1771252366\" width=314 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Lord Verkins is a hand-drawn visual novel with beautiful artwork from different artists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the events of the Great War, Queen Verkins eventually took over her father's throne as one of the rulers of the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is lonely but has her best friend, Galzra, to talk to. This is a short visual novel